    "privacy.h3": "Disclosure",
    "privacy.p4":
      "We do not sell your personal information. We may disclose information when required by law, or to trusted service providers who assist with communications or operations under appropriate confidentiality obligations.",
    "privacy.h4": "Data Security",
    "privacy.p5":
      "We take reasonable measures to protect information submitted to us. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.",
